  "title": "Staff Engineer: How to find time to work on broader-scope problems",
  "summary": "One of the most challenging transitions in a software engineering career is the shift from Senior Engineer to Staff Engineer. It is not merely a promotion to the next level but a role change. The functions are different, and the scope of work tends to be broader. While levels beyond senior are not new in the industry, there is no consensus on the responsibilities of these roles.",
